@startuml tool1-never-lose-work
title Tool 1 - Never lose work (durable runtime)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2E7D32

rectangle "Step 1\nread order" as S1 #E8F5E9
rectangle "Step 2\ncharge card" as S2 #E8F5E9
rectangle "Step 3\nsend email" as S3 #E8F5E9

S1 -right-> S2
S2 -right-> S3

rectangle "** CRASH ** after step 2" as C #FFCDD2

S2 .down.> C

rectangle "Without Keel:\nstart over -> card\ncharged TWICE" as BAD #FFCDD2
rectangle "With Keel:\nresume at step 3 ->\ncard charged ONCE" as GOOD #C8E6C9

C -down-> BAD
C -down-> GOOD

note bottom of GOOD
  Keel remembers each finished step and
  each real action, so a restart never
  repeats something that already happened.
end note
@enduml
